        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG116/204 Satin Stainless Steel Modern Square Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by AHI, the SIG-116 Square Lever with Square Rose is the perfect example of modern sophistication. The sharp lines and clean angles of this stainless steel leverset is the perfect way to add a contemporary touch to modern spaces. The lever is all 304 grade stainless steel, making it resistant to knocks, scratches and abrasions. It will fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2\".  Durable in appearance and function even after many years of use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG116-specifications.gif?v=1704354672\" width=\"523\" height=129\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI-SIG116/240 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Square Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG116/204 Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" (64 mm) squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 0.35\" (9 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Lever with Square Rose, AHI SIG116/204",
                "description": "AHI SIG116/204 Square Lever with Square Rose - Made by AHI, the SIG-116 Square Lever with Square Rose is the perfect example of modern sophistication. The sharp lines and clean angles of this stainless steel leverset is the perfect way to add a contemporary touch to modern spaces. The lever is all stainless steel, making it resistant to knocks, scratches and abrasions. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG116/240, AHI SIG116/204 square door levers, AHI SIG 116, ada compliant levers, modern door levers, contemporary door levers, safety code compliant levers, ahi sigma line levers, Satin Stainless Steel Modern Square Roses, Satin Stainless Steel Modern Square Rose, modern square leversets, stainless steel levers, Satin Stainless Steel Modern Square Levers, AHI door levers,"
